    family-names: Sabzchi Dehkharghani
repository-code: "https://github.com/hamedsabzchi/libya-emberger-bioclimate"
url: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22151541"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible Google Earth Engine JavaScript and Python workflows for
  historical and recent Emberger bioclimatic zoning in Libya, including
  WorldClim, TerraClimate, ERA5-Land, CHIRPS-ERA5 hybrid analysis,
  cross-dataset sensitivity assessment, area statistics, interactive maps,
  and GeoTIFF exports.
keywords:
  - bioclimatic zoning
  - Emberger Q2
  - Google Earth Engine
